You'll probably get dozens of responses to this one, but it is in fact a kind
of sword.  I believe it is often paired with a katana and may be used as a
weapon for one's "other" hand.  Of course, you can't do this in nethack,
but I guess it makes a nice spare weapon to throw at things, or perhaps as
a backup in case your katana breaks.

